    {
      "subId": "601628",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "60161901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "60161901": {
            "id": "60161901",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "I'm aware you've been working on some little tricks to surprise me with, but it appears that none of them have come to fruition.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161902"
            ]
          },
          "60161902": {
            "id": "60161902",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "My guess would be that you're trying to bring Columbina back. But then, where is Sandrone? Or are you trying to buy time for her?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161903"
            ]
          },
          "60161903": {
            "id": "60161903",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Heh... I always found their friendship to be a curious phenomenon. Two highly incongruent personalities, and yet they share a deep connection.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161904"
            ]
          },
          "60161904": {
            "id": "60161904",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Speaking of Columbina, I once saw her as like a younger sister. We got along quite amicably while she was with the Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161905"
            ]
          },
          "60161905": {
            "id": "60161905",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "But then one day, she suddenly decided she would refuse to take part in any further experiments. To this day, I truly don't understand what I could have done to upset her so much.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161906"
            ]
          },
          "60161906": {
            "id": "60161906",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "It's such a pity. I could have had a sister, a family... But alas, she grew to dislike me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161907"
            ]
          },
          "60161907": {
            "id": "60161907",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You're not fit to be family to her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161908"
            ]
          },
          "60161908": {
            "id": "60161908",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "That, I can't deny.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161909"
            ]
          },
          "60161909": {
            "id": "60161909",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "So many people, all obsessed with playing out the same tired old dramas. This world is rotten to the core.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161910"
            ]
          },
          "60161910": {
            "id": "60161910",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "And then there's you... You had every opportunity to reach the right conclusion. The thought of killing you off like this... Hehe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161911"
            ]
          },
          "60161911": {
            "id": "60161911",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "But I maintain that I approached you in good faith. So I will offer you another chance. Will you work with me? You have until I count to ten to make your choice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161912"
            ]
          },
          "60161912": {
            "id": "60161912",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "One. Two. Three...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161913"
            ]
          },
          "60161913": {
            "id": "60161913",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Not in a million years!)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161914"
            ]
          },
          "60161914": {
            "id": "60161914",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161915"
            ]
          },
          "60161915": {
            "id": "60161915",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Sandrone? What a pleasant surprise. I didn't think you'd join us all the way up here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161916"
            ]
          },
          "60161916": {
            "id": "60161916",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "You're as sick and twisted as ever. Don't fool yourself into thinking anyone's grateful for the chances you're offering them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161944"
            ]
          },
          "60161944": {
            "id": "60161944",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Sandrone? But the formula hasn't finished running yet...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161917"
            ]
          },
          "60161917": {
            "id": "60161917",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "#Funnily enough, I was just discussing a collaboration opportunity with {NICKNAME}. And then I see you... who, I must say, is a good example of an opportunity gone to waste.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161918"
            ]
          },
          "60161918": {
            "id": "60161918",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Gone to waste?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161919"
            ]
          },
          "60161919": {
            "id": "60161919",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "I said that everyone would get one chance. And you've used yours to march right back into the lion's den... So yes, it's an utterly wasted opportunity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161920"
            ]
          },
          "60161920": {
            "id": "60161920",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Hah! And what makes you think I believe a word that comes out of your mouth?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161921"
            ]
          },
          "60161921": {
            "id": "60161921",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "I was planning on disposing of your little formula after wrapping up more urgent business here. But since you've taken the trouble of serving it to me on a silver platter, I can simply bring it forward in the schedule.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161922"
            ]
          },
          "60161922": {
            "id": "60161922",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "CS",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161923"
            ]
          },
          "60161923": {
            "id": "60161923",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sandrone...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161924"
            ]
          },
          "60161924": {
            "id": "60161924",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Now you see how fragile mechanical contraptions are. Just a gentle tap... and they fall to pieces.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161925"
            ]
          },
          "60161925": {
            "id": "60161925",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "However keen of an inventor Sandrone may have been, her death spells the end of the formula that was running inside her body.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161926"
            ]
          },
          "60161926": {
            "id": "60161926",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Of course, I have to commend her for making it this far. As her colleague, I have to admire her stubborn tenacity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161927"
            ]
          },
          "60161927": {
            "id": "60161927",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Now, it is time for you to take your place by my side.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161928"
            ]
          },
          "60161928": {
            "id": "60161928",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161929"
            ]
          },
          "60161929": {
            "id": "60161929",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "My count was interrupted, but the second chance I extended to you still stands. Once again — you are welcome to join me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161930"
            ]
          },
          "60161930": {
            "id": "60161930",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "By now, I'm sure you have gained a greater appreciation for the power and authority I wield. What is stopping you from embracing a new world of endless possibilities?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161931"
            ]
          },
          "60161931": {
            "id": "60161931",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161932"
            ]
          },
          "60161932": {
            "id": "60161932",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Not in the mood to talk? As you wish. You seem less talkative than usual today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161933"
            ]
          },
          "60161933": {
            "id": "60161933",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "I'll change the topic to something more... apropos. Sandrone was always like this. Never trusting anyone, always so reluctant to share her research with them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161934"
            ]
          },
          "60161934": {
            "id": "60161934",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Objectively speaking, she had her strengths. It is remarkable how she extracted and even optimized the world-formula from so much data.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161935"
            ]
          },
          "60161935": {
            "id": "60161935",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "But her inability to trust was her undoing. Had she allowed someone else to monitor or run the formula for her, you might still have a chance at victory even now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161936"
            ]
          },
          "60161936": {
            "id": "60161936",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "But regrettably, she was a stubborn fool. As much as it pains me, she had to go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161937"
            ]
          },
          "60161937": {
            "id": "60161937",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...Dottore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161938"
            ]
          },
          "60161938": {
            "id": "60161938",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Maybe this is news to you, but people can change. Columbina surprised you when she escaped... And I think Sandrone would surprise you, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161939"
            ]
          },
          "60161939": {
            "id": "60161939",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Change?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161940"
            ]
          },
          "60161940": {
            "id": "60161940",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You can twist the truth however you want, but I see it, clear as day: You're the one who can't trust other people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161941"
            ]
          },
          "60161941": {
            "id": "60161941",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "Is that how you see me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161942"
            ]
          },
          "60161942": {
            "id": "60161942",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "60161943"
            ]
          },
          "60161943": {
            "id": "60161943",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Il Dottore",
            "text": "By this point, what can you hope to do about it?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
